Eat a lizard if you are slowing down (dead lizards do not rot).

It is VERY difficult to get stone resistance. The only way I know is to
polymorph yourself in a lizard and eat a dead cockatrice corpse.
Warning! Stone resistance has it's disadvantages. Sometimes your food will
turn to stone.

